Verdict: NOT_SUPPORTED
Rationale: The claim states that Bengaluru Vijaya 'B.V.' Radha started her career in the 1964 Kannada film based on the life of Purandara Dasa, who was born in 1484. While one evidence supports that B.V. Radha began her career in the 1964 film 'Navakoti Narayana,' there is no reliable evidence confirming that this film was based on the life of Purandara Dasa. Additionally, the claim about Purandara Dasa's birth year (1484) is contradicted by evidence stating he was born around 1470. Therefore, the claim is not fully supported.
